--TEST--
`Ldap\Settings.base` is where every search without its own `base` starts, so a `tainted` one does not compile, the same as `search`'s `base` option — `rule:security/tainted-qualifier`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Directory {
    public static function at(tainted string $base): Core\Ldap\Connection {
        return Core\Ldap::open({url: "ldaps://directory.example.test", base: $base});
    }
}
--EXPECT--

--EXPECTF-ERROR--
error[E0401]: expected `string|Core\Ldap\Dn`, found `tainted string`
